        "notes": "In the experimental area there is a hut (owner Club Alpino Italiano, Sezione di Torino) which is open from June to September. This hut is equipped with electricity produced by solar panels (see: https://www.rifugiogastaldi.com/). in the hut there is a phone, in the area there is no mobile phone signal. Close to the hut, there is an AWS (owner ARPA Piemonte). This AWS has been active since 1988 and the data it has acquired has good continuity and few missing values (see http://webgis.arpa.piemonte.it/bancadatimeteo/php/meteo.php?CODTOT=001019900). During the summer 2016, we have installed a 360° webcam, at 2775 m a.s.l., on the left morain of the Bessanese glacier. This webcam is equipped with electricity produced by solar panels. During the summer 2021, the webcam was moved close to the hut (2659 m a.s.l.).\r\n",
